OL,5,G1200 Discovering: Leonard Cohen
OL,6,     FA look at the life and music of
OL,7,     FCanadian singer-songwriter Leonard
OL,8,     FCohen, who was known for his
OL,9,     Fpoetic lyrics and iconic songs,
OL,10,     Fsuch as Bird on the Wire and
OL,11,     FHallelujah. (S5, ep 21)
OL,12,G1230 Discovering: The Doors
